Cell["\<\
This notebook follows this paper: \
https://pubs.aip.org/aip/jmp/article/50/8/082702/920148/A-group-theoretical-\
identification-of-integrable
The point is to get a lot of their results in this notebook so that we can \
then apply them to our case.\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998039596477367*^9, 
  3.998039622618725*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fb5618c2-1386-44c9-91b6-\
